      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "person is 'just trying to do my part'",
      "description": "The text 'just trying to do my part' is overlaid on the image of the person standing in front of the neon sign. This creates an analogical mapping where the person (visual entity) is being identified as the subject performing the action described in the text — i.e., 'just trying to do my part'. The phrase implies the person is participating in something (likely the establishment's services) with a tone of ironic self-deprecation, mapping their presence and action onto the textual statement.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
