      "label": "User projected onto the person in the scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the silhouette of the person standing in front of the neon sign, as the meme's text 'just trying to do my part' implies the viewer is identifying with the person's action or role in the depicted scenario. This is a common meme format where the viewer sees themselves in the subject's position, even without explicit deictic pronouns.",
